<title>UK: Howden shares climb amid bid speculation.</title>
<headline>Howden shares climb amid bid speculation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British engineering equipment maker Howden Group Plc climbed on Monday amid speculation that it may be the subject of a bid, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were 10-1/2p higher at 94p by 1035 GMT.</p>
<p>The Times newspaper reported that a bid for Howden could emerge this month, citing &quot;City sources&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;There have been a few speculative buyers after some bid talk this morning,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
